 "_doc": "Foes. kind: animal, human, uncanny, anomaly. composure is what the party has to wear down; attack [low, high] is the range a plain move rolls; speed sets turn order (party members run 5 to 9). moves: a string is a plain attack with that name; a dict is {name, type: attack|horror|status|all, damage: <type>, power: [a, b], status: <status>, text}. horror drains Composure as spirit and may leave the target unnerved; all hits everyone. An anomaly has phases, one tell per phase ({text, method: photograph|record|read, evidence: <case evidence id>}); the party wins by capturing every tell or lasting `turns` turns, and cannot run. weak/resist list damage types; `known: true` shows the weakness from the start.",
